# KAREN uses one .env per service (apps/<service>/.env), mirroring deployment where each ECS
# task receives only its own configuration. Run `pnpm setup:env` to create them from each
# apps/<service>/.env.example. Canonical reference: docs/development/environment-variables.md
#
# Local infrastructure (docker-compose.yml) — fixed, local-only values bound to 127.0.0.1:
#   PostgreSQL  postgresql://karen:karen_local_only@localhost:5442/karen   (+ karen_test, karen_shadow)
#   Redis       redis://localhost:6390
#   Temporal    localhost:7233   (UI http://localhost:8233)
#
# No real credentials are needed for local development. Never commit a real secret.
